## Port of pumpkin/src/plugin/api/events/player/mod.rs: the player event modules, and `PlayerEvent` (`get_player`).
##
## `PlayerEvent` is a trait upstream; here every event object has a `getPlayer` proc of its own, so the trait is a convention
## and this module only gathers the modules (import this one to get all of them, as `use ...::player::*` does).
## The `InteractAction` of player_interact_event has the same member names as the WIT mirror in src/plugin_api/eventdata.aowl.

